{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52798","headline":"古铜雀台歌（题拟） · 张鼎","name":"古铜雀台歌（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铜雀苍苍对古馗，清风切切有余悲。\n试忆望陵三五夜，便是西园明月时。\n（见《文苑英华》卷五二《古铜雀台赋》附）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张鼎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52798.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52798","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}